    "title": "Weight Gain on DTG Regimen",
    "message": "Guidelines state the possibility of weight gain should be discussed when starting all ART regimens, as obesity is an increasing problem in HIV care. The patient has gained 17 kg (BMI increased from 25.6 to 32.4 kg/m²) over 18 months since switching to TLD (TDF/3TC/DTG). She also reports fatigue. Acanthosis nigricans suggests insulin resistance. While DTG-containing regimens are associated with weight gain, non-drug contributors like diet, exercise, and family history of diabetes should also be considered.",
